_model: definition
---
title: Definition 19
---
order: 19
---
short_label: I.Def.19
---
statement: <i>Rectilinear figures</i> are those which are contained by straight lines, <i>trilateral</i> figures being those contained by three, <i>quadrilateral</i> those contained by four, and <i>multilateral</i> those contained by more than four straight lines.
---
body:
